# Health Data Visualization Guide

The [run_visualization.py](mdc:run_visualization.py) script generates comprehensive visualizations of health data using the `DataVisualizer` class.

## Key Visualizations
1. Exercise Patterns
   - Exercise duration by type with intensity
   - Weekly exercise pattern heatmap
   - Exercise duration vs heart rate correlation

2. Sleep and Nutrition
   - Sleep quality vs calorie intake
   - Macronutrient distribution

3. Cross-Domain Analysis
   - 24-hour activity distribution
   - Correlation between different health metrics

## Usage
1. Ensure data files are present in `Data/someshbgd3/Cleaned/`
2. Run `python run_visualization.py`
3. Visualizations will be saved in `analysis_reports/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS/`

## Dependencies
- pandas - Data manipulation
- matplotlib - Core plotting
- seaborn - Statistical visualizations
- scipy - Statistical analysis
